%
(DMC2 SCRIPT 1)
(DMC2 EFFECTS axis-motion;spindle;digital-output;coordinate-state;external-command)
(DMC2 REQUIRES running-session;estop-clear;machine-on;interpreter-idle;all-homed)
(DMC2 RECOVERY abort-task)
(DMC2 END)
(BTER TOOL HEIGHT - SINGLE SLOW TOUCH; original 6 mm/min)
(Position manually over the recorded setter contact XY before Run.)
(No X/Y motion: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
(Shared implementation captures each trigger before backoff or return.)
(Reports tool height above the plate; does not write tool or work offsets.)
o<ts_entry_preview> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    (PREVIEW,stop)
    M2
o<ts_entry_preview> endif
o<dmc2_tool_setter_measure> call [1]
M2
%
